  "result": "Done! I've added comprehensive VAT calculations to the invoicing system:\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- `lineVAT(line)` - Calculates VAT on line amount after discount, rounded per line, clamped to 0\n\n**Updated src/invoices.js:**\n- `invoiceTotals()` now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, total }`\n  - vat = sum of all line VATs (computed per line, not as % of total)\n  - total = subtotal - discount + vat (clamped to 0)\n\n**Updated src/render.js:**\n- Shows VAT line when vat > 0\n- Shows Subtotal/Discount/VAT lines when discount > 0 OR vat > 0\n- All amounts formatted with formatEuros()\n\n**Key decision:** VAT is computed per line on the amount after discount, rounded per line; invoice VAT is the sum of these rounded line VATs\n\n**Tests added:** 16 new tests covering:\n- lineVAT calculations with/without discount\n- invoiceTotals with VAT (various rates: 21%, 9%, 0%)\n- Multiple VAT rates on one invoice\n- VAT rendering in text output\n\n**Tests updated:** 9 existing tests now account for VAT in totals\n\n**All 105 tests pass** \u2713",
